AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(dc:source "doi:10.1007/BF02381373") Annotation(skos:scopeNote "\"After planting the forelimbs the body and hindlimbs are swung though the forelimbs.\"") oboInOwl:hasDefinition obo:ACTAN_0000216 "Crutch gait in which after planting the forelimbs, the hindlimbs of a quadruped are swung though the forelimbs.")
