# Class: obo:ACTAN_0000408 (two dimension)

AnnotationAssertion(terms:conformsTo obo:ACTAN_0000408 <https://github.com/Active-Animals/Ontology/patterns/disposition_by_quality>)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:created_by obo:ACTAN_0000408 "Ditch Townsend")
