# Class: obo:ACTAN_0000478 (mass-spawn clustering)

AnnotationAssertion(terms:conformsTo obo:ACTAN_0000478 <https://github.com/Active-Animals/Ontology/patterns/context_by_entity>)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:created_by obo:ACTAN_0000478 "Ditch Townsend")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:creation_date obo:ACTAN_0000478 "2024-11-18T16:59:44.667862Z")
