# Class: obo:ACTAN_0000506 (submission ranking)

AnnotationAssertion(terms:conformsTo obo:ACTAN_0000506 <https://github.com/Active-Animals/Ontology/patterns/context_composite>)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:created_by obo:ACTAN_0000506 "Ditch Townsend")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:creation_date obo:ACTAN_0000506 "2024-12-28T12:15:17.89072Z")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:isDefinedBy "doi:10.1163/156853981X00220") Annotation(skos:scopeNote "\"It seems that during the fight a fish becomes aware of its inferior strength and then gives up.\"") oboInOwl:hasDefinition obo:ACTAN_0000506 "Ranking that becomes aware of its inferior strength and gives up.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(dc:date "1950"^^xsd:decimal) Annotation(dc:source "doi:10.1163/156853981X00220") oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:ACTAN_0000506 "inferiorism")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(dc:date "1950"^^xsd:decimal) Annotation(dc:source "doi:10.1163/156853981X00220") oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:ACTAN_0000506 "inferiority")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(dc:date "1999"^^xsd:decimal) Annotation(dc:source "doi:10.1537/ase.107.141") oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:ACTAN_0000506 "submission")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(dc:date "1950"^^xsd:decimal) Annotation(dc:source "doi:10.1163/156853981X00220") oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:ACTAN_0000506 "submissive behaviour"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(dc:date "1998"^^xsd:decimal) Annotation(dc:source "doi:10.1002/(SICI)1098-2337(1998)24:3<197::AID-AB4>3.0.CO;2-I") oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:ACTAN_0000506 "subordination")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(dc:date "2012"^^xsd:decimal) Annotation(dc:source "doi:10.1007/s10539-011-9297-8") oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:ACTAN_0000506 "yielding")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(dc:contributor "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4277-2151") rdfs:label obo:ACTAN_0000506 "submission ranking")
AnnotationAssertion(skos:closeMatch obo:ACTAN_0000506 "NBO:0000122")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(dc:source "doi:10.1089/zeb.2012.0861") skos:example obo:ACTAN_0000506 "\"Zebrafish...

An agonistic behavior during fighting, when one fish slightly drops its tail for a short period of time, to signal its submission and end the confrontation.\"")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(dc:source "doi:10.1089/zeb.2012.0861") skos:scopeNote obo:ACTAN_0000506 "\"A social behavior following aggressive confrontations between zebrafish.\"")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(dc:source "http://www.nativefishlab.net/library/textpdf/15582.pdf") skos:scopeNote obo:ACTAN_0000506 "\"There are two flight situations in which backing up is commonly observed. The less common occasion is when one fish avoids another ; this is sometimes observed when a juvenile Badis badis is confronted by a larger one.\"")
SubClassOf(obo:ACTAN_0000506 obo:ACTAN_0000552)
SubClassOf(obo:ACTAN_0000506 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:BFO_0000051 obo:ACTAN_0000337))

