AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(dc:source "doi:10.1163/156853981X00220") skos:example obo:ACTAN_0000571 "\"Two individuals of Helostoma temmincki often show a ceremony in which, standing opposite each other, they press the maximally opened jaws against those of the opponent. Because of this ceremony the fish has got the popular name (at least in Holland) of kissing-fish.\"")
