AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(dc:source "doi:10.1089/zeb.2012.0861") skos:example obo:ACTAN_0000581 "\"While early views questioned pain responses in fish, mounting evidence indicates the presence of pain and pain-related behavior in zebrafish.\"")
