This may be to access, allogroom, autogroom, or clear.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(dc:date "2021"^^xsd:decimal) Annotation(dc:source "doi:10.1111/tops.12554") oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:ACTAN_0000787 "wipe with an object"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(dc:contributor "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4277-2151") rdfs:label obo:ACTAN_0000787 "wiping tooling")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(dc:source "doi:10.1537/ase.107.141") skos:scopeNote obo:ACTAN_0000787 "\"Use of leaves, straw, paper, and so on to wipe dirt (feces, urine, mud, ejaculate, and so on) from self or others...\"")
SubClassOf(obo:ACTAN_0000787 obo:ACTAN_0000286)
SubClassOf(obo:ACTAN_0000787 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:BFO_0000051 obo:ACTAN_0000784))
