AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(dc:contributor "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4277-2151") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Directly inferred.") oboInOwl:hasDefinition obo:ACTAN_0000940 "Protraction that results from appendage protracting.")
