AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(dc:contributor "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4277-2151") Annotation(dc:source "doi:10.1002/jez.1819") oboInOwl:hasDefinition obo:ACTAN_0000954 "Placement that results from a flag oscillation reduced to a frequency of zero.")
