# Class: obo:UBERON_0002101 (limb)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "UBERONREF:0000003") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:UBERON_0002101 "A paired appendage that is evolved from a paired fin. The extent of this structure includes autopod, stylopod and zeugopod regions when present, but excludes the girdle and its parts.")
