AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000232 obo:UBERON_0002199 "in FMA intergument = skin+superficial fascia(hypodermis), skin=dermis+epidermis+hair_nail. Note that the definition provided here excludes the more general sense of the term 'integument' used in invertebrates; consider 'integumental system'. Note that the VSAO class appears to include adnexa by its definition.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:date_retrieved "2012-06-20") Annotation(oboInOwl:external_class "AAO:0000239") Annotation(oboInOwl:ontology "AAO") Annotation(oboInOwl:source "AAO:EJS") obo:UBPROP_0000001 obo:UBERON_0002199 "Anatomical system that protects the body from damage, comprising the skin and its appendages.[AAO]")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:date_retrieved "2012-08-14") Annotation(oboInOwl:external_class "VSAO:0000029") Annotation(oboInOwl:ontology "VSAO") Annotation(oboInOwl:source "PSPUB:0000170") obo:UBPROP_0000001 obo:UBERON_0002199 "Surface structure that is the outer protective covering of the body.[VSAO]")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:date_retrieved "2012-08-14") Annotation(oboInOwl:external_class "TAO:0000368") Annotation(oboInOwl:ontology "TAO") Annotation(oboInOwl:source "ZFIN:curator") obo:UBPROP_0000001 obo:UBERON_0002199 "The outer protective barrier that separates the animal from its aquatic environment. Le Guellec et al, 2004.[TAO]")
